      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A deliberate attempt is made to stress the nonspecificity of headache and the complexity of its work-up. The choice of radiographic studies for its evaluation should be governed by the strongly considered etiology. This article deals with the most likely causes of headaches in an athlete. The merits and limitations of currently available radiographic modalities to detect headache-producing diseases are broadly discussed."},
